For more information and system requirements see DESCRIPTION file.
This is a beta version so many things are not yet implemented as they are supposed to.

YAGF 2.0 revival work has started in the revival/ directory. See
revival/README.md for the Qt 6 prototype, build instructions, current
features, and known limitations. The root CMakeLists.txt still builds
the historical Qt 4 application.

The main things to do are
- adding more image prepocessing features
- adding packet recognition
Contributors are welcome.
Contact me via anb@symmetrica.net.
